  "job_B22.3_20251003_114602": {
    "chunk_text": "Her ongin\u00f0 embe twelf derwyr\u00f0an stanas & gimmas \u00fee we leornudan in pocalipsis \u00fe\u00e6re bec. \u00d0\u00e6t \u00e6reste gimcynn is \u00fe\u00e6t is blac & grene, & \u00fea hiw syndon buto tog\u00e6dere gemencgede, & sindon on O\u00fe\u00e6r is saphyrus, se is sunnan gelic, & on him standa\u00f0 swilce gildene steorran. \u00d0ridde is calcedonius haten, se ys byrnendum blacerne gelic. Feor\u00fea smaragdus, se ys swi\u00f0e grene. Fyfta sardonix is haten, se is blode licost. Syxta onichinus is haten, se is ge brun & h\u00e6wen. Seofo\u00f0a sardius haten, se is luttran blode gelic. Ehto\u00fea is berillus haten, se is luttran w\u00e6tere gelic. Nigo\u00fea is crisoprassus haten, se is grenum lece gelic, & swilce him grene steorran of scinan. Andlyfta is topazius haten, se is golde gelic. Twelfta is carbunculus haten, se is byrnende glede gelic. Sum stan is \u00fee adamans hatte, nele hine isern ne style ne awiht heardes gretan, ac \u00e6lc bi\u00f0 \u00fee forcu\u00f0ra Sum stan hatte magneten, gif \u00fe\u00e6t isern bi\u00f0 bufan \u00fe\u00e6m stane, hit wyle feallan on \u00feane stan, gyf se stan Abestus hatte sum stancynn on claudea rice. Gif he wyr\u00f0 onbyrnede, ne m\u00e6g hine w\u00e6ter ne wind adw\u00e6scan. Sum stan is on persa rice, gif \u00feu hine mid handa ahrinest, he birne\u00f0 sona. Se stan is haten piriten. Seleten hatte sum stan \u00fe\u00e6s gecyndu sind \u00fe\u00e6t he mid wex",
